 #: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:242
 msgid ""
 "A counted repetition nested in another, both with bodies that can repeat "
-"empty, keeps one entry per count value. Storage depends on the combination of "
-"counts: `((a?){100000}){100000}` is one measured storage refusal, not a minimum "
-"count threshold. Searching for the match of `((a?){1000}){1000}b` over 100 KB "
-"reaches the step bound. A backreference keeps the backtracking matcher, whose exponential "
-"exploration (`^(a|aa)*c\\1$` over forty `a`) the step bound refuses after "
-"about 3 s of work."
+"empty, keeps one entry per count value. Storage depends on the combination "
+"of counts: `((a?){100000}){100000}` is one measured storage refusal, not a "
+"minimum count threshold. Searching for the match of `((a?){1000}){1000}b` "
+"over 100 KB reaches the step bound. A backreference keeps the backtracking "
+"matcher, whose exponential exploration (`^(a|aa)*c\\1$` over forty `a`) the "
+"step bound refuses after about 3 s of work."
 msgstr ""
 "嵌套在另一个计数重复中、且两者的主体都能重复空串的计数重复，会为每个计数值保"
-"留一项。存储量取决于计数的组合：`((a?){100000}){100000}` 是经过测量的存储"
-"拒绝示例，并非最小计数阈值。在 100 KB 上搜索 `((a?){1000}){1000}b` 的匹配会"
-"达到步数上限。含"
-"反向引用的模式保留回溯匹配器，其指数级探索（在四十个 `a` 上的 `^(a|"
+"留一项。存储量取决于计数的组合：`((a?){100000}){100000}` 是经过测量的存储拒绝"
+"示例，并非最小计数阈值。在 100 KB 上搜索 `((a?){1000}){1000}b` 的匹配会达到步"
+"数上限。含反向引用的模式保留回溯匹配器，其指数级探索（在四十个 `a` 上的 `^(a|"
 "aa)*c\\1$`）会在约 3 秒的工作后被步数上限拒绝。"
 
 #: src/project/diagnostic-codes.md:252
@@ -24939,3 +24955,117 @@
 "**SARIF**——每条结果的 `ruleId` 即该代码，并在本次运行的规则表中带有一个 "
 "`reportingDescriptor`（[`purrdf-validate`](https://docs.rs/purrdf-"
 "validate)）。"
+<<<<<<< .our
+|||||||
+
+#~ msgid ""
+#~ "the nearest decimal with at most 18 fractional digits, ties toward zero; "
+#~ "`NaN`, `INF` and values of 2^127 or more are errors"
+#~ msgstr ""
+#~ "最多 18 位小数的最接近的 decimal，平局取靠近零的一方；`NaN`、`INF` 以及大"
+#~ "于等于 2^127 的值为错误"
+
+#~ msgid ""
+#~ "the fractional part discarded; `NaN`, `INF` and values outside the target "
+#~ "type are errors"
+#~ msgstr "舍去小数部分；`NaN`、`INF` 以及超出目标类型范围的值为错误"
+=======
+
+#~ msgid ""
+#~ "rdflib 7.6's `initBindings` is not the reference for this behaviour: it "
+#~ "rebinds a pre-bound name wherever the query assigns it, so an assignment "
+#~ "there overrides the bound value instead of joining with it. PurRDF "
+#~ "follows the single join rule above at every depth."
+#~ msgstr ""
+#~ "rdflib 7.6 的 `initBindings` 不是这一行为的参照：查询在何处为预绑定名称赋"
+#~ "值，它就在何处重新绑定该名称，因此那里的赋值会覆盖所绑定的值，而不是与之连"
+#~ "接。PurRDF 在每一层深度上都遵循上述单一的连接规则。"
+
+#~ msgid ""
+#~ "The rdflib compatibility shim passes `initBindings` to the native engine "
+#~ "as substitutions, so `purrdf.compat.rdflib.Graph.query(..., "
+#~ "initBindings=...)` refuses a reassignment as `Store.query` and "
+#~ "`Store.prepare` do."
+#~ msgstr ""
+#~ "rdflib 兼容层把 `initBindings` 作为替换传给原生引擎，因此 "
+#~ "`purrdf.compat.rdflib.Graph.query(..., initBindings=...)` 与 "
+#~ "`Store.query` 和 `Store.prepare` 一样拒绝重新赋值。"
+
+#~ msgid ""
+#~ "Both use strict expected-failure ledgers: every known divergence is "
+#~ "listed with a per-test reason, an unexpected failure breaks the build, "
+#~ "and a silently fixed divergence also breaks the build until the ledger "
+#~ "shrinks. The ledgered residuals cover corners like Graph-subclass "
+#~ "identity through set operators, `rdf:List`/Collection mutation, "
+#~ "`Result.bindings` / `SELECT *` subselect projection, graph-prefix "
+#~ "forwarding, and legacy `ConjunctiveGraph` semantics — consult the ledgers "
+#~ "for the current, exact list."
+#~ msgstr ""
+#~ "两者都使用严格的预期失败台账：每个已知分歧都连同逐测试的原因一起列出，意外"
+#~ "失败会使构建失败，而被静默修复的分歧同样会使构建失败，直到台账缩减为止。入"
+#~ "台账的残余涵盖一些边角情况，例如经由集合运算符的 Graph 子类标识、"
+#~ "`rdf:List`/Collection 修改、`Result.bindings` / `SELECT *` 子查询投影、图"
+#~ "前缀转发，以及旧式 `ConjunctiveGraph` 语义——当前的精确列表请查阅台账。"
+
+#~ msgid ""
+#~ "the nearest decimal with at most 18 fractional digits, ties toward zero; "
+#~ "`NaN`, `INF` and values of 2^127 or more are errors"
+#~ msgstr ""
+#~ "最多 18 位小数的最接近的 decimal，平局取靠近零的一方；`NaN`、`INF` 以及大"
+#~ "于等于 2^127 的值为错误"
+
+#~ msgid ""
+#~ "the fractional part discarded; `NaN`, `INF` and values outside the target "
+#~ "type are errors"
+#~ msgstr "舍去小数部分；`NaN`、`INF` 以及超出目标类型范围的值为错误"
+
+#~ msgid ""
+#~ "Direct SHACL remains authoritative. Ontology-only fields are optional; "
+#~ "`owl:FunctionalProperty` gives a scalar representation with approximation "
+#~ "provenance, while inverse functionality does not. Closed shapes reject "
+#~ "unshaped fields unless they are directly present or ignored. Classes "
+#~ "without a target shape are emitted as open carriers, never as fabricated "
+#~ "closed models. This is not ABox materialization or unrestricted OWL: "
+#~ "property chains and axioms outside the fragment do not create fields."
+#~ msgstr ""
+#~ "直接的 SHACL 仍是权威。仅来自本体的字段是可选的；`owl:FunctionalProperty` "
+#~ "给出标量表示，并附带标明其为近似的溯源信息（approximation provenance），而"
+#~ "逆函数性不会如此。封闭形状拒绝未被形状描述的字段，除非这些字段直接出现或被"
+#~ "忽略。没有目标形状的类以开放载体的形式输出，绝不会被输出为捏造的封闭模型。"
+#~ "这既不是 ABox 物化，也不是不受限的 OWL：属性链以及该片段之外的公理不会产生"
+#~ "字段。"
+
+#~ msgid ""
+#~ "`SchemaCoverageReport` accounts for every catalogued property once, "
+#~ "including exclusions, with sorted per-class outcomes and source-axiom "
+#~ "provenance. `SchemaCompileRequest::coverage_report` can produce it before "
+#~ "emission. The request cache key binds RDFC-1.0 identities for the shapes "
+#~ "and ontology graphs, caller namespaces, mode, value-vocabulary marker, "
+#~ "compiler/policy salts, and the fixed ceilings: 65,536 properties, 65,536 "
+#~ "classes, 1,048,576 relation or coverage cells, and expression depth 64. "
+#~ "Malformed OWL lists, contradictory property kinds/ranges, key collisions, "
+#~ "and limit exhaustion are typed failures."
+#~ msgstr ""
+#~ "`SchemaCoverageReport` 对每个收录的属性恰好计入一次（包括被排除的属性），"
+#~ "并附有排序后的逐类结果与源公理溯源。"
+#~ "`SchemaCompileRequest::coverage_report` 可以在输出之前生成它。请求缓存键绑"
+#~ "定形状图与本体图的 RDFC-1.0 标识、调用方命名空间、模式（mode）、值词汇标"
+#~ "记、编译器/策略盐值，以及固定上限：65,536 个属性、65,536 个类、1,048,576 "
+#~ "个关系或覆盖单元格，以及表达式深度 64。格式错误的 OWL 列表、相互矛盾的属性"
+#~ "种类/值域、键冲突以及上限耗尽，都是带类型的失败。"
+
+#~ msgid ""
+#~ "Emission fails before returning bytes for invalid caller configuration, "
+#~ "malformed schema keywords, `$id` rebasing, external/indirect/dangling "
+#~ "`$ref`, `$dynamicRef`/`$recursiveRef`, alias cycles, unsatisfiable closed "
+#~ "required fields, and generated-name collisions. The fixed limits are 16 "
+#~ "MiB for the input schema, each artifact, and one codec value; 65,536 "
+#~ "definitions, fields per object, or finite values; depth 128; and 255 "
+#~ "bytes per GraphQL name."
+#~ msgstr ""
+#~ "对于无效的调用方配置、格式错误的模式关键字、`$id` 重定基准、外部/间接/悬空"
+#~ "的 `$ref`、`$dynamicRef`/`$recursiveRef`、别名环、无法满足的封闭必需字段以"
+#~ "及生成名称冲突，输出会在返回字节之前失败。固定上限为：输入模式、每个工件与"
+#~ "单个编解码值各 16 MiB；定义数、每个对象的字段数或有限值数各 65,536；深度 "
+#~ "128；每个 GraphQL 名称 255 字节。"
